  "notes": "Legacy conversion of origin idea 32 ('Knotted Origin', PROXY mapping) from the v3 100-origin sweep. Best primary measure: density (protocol: any of density, xi, energy; Bonferroni k = 3, |z| > 3.32). Size axis = size. Label computed by the local legacy re-analysis (build/cards_build.py), NOT by the repo gate checker; label_set_by is deliberately absent. Ceiling is DIFFERS: no server lock, no shuffled null, no double size, no stranger replication. Lock: hash covers the locked protocol file, engine hash, settings, control, seeds and sizes; server_timestamp is the author's local lock stamp (2026-11-13 14:11:22 -0600) converted to UTC, not a server stamp. Reproduced: an independent local rerun on the same box gave byte-identical outputs at every seed (same lineage, so not a stranger replication). Toy universe: shows mechanisms, never predicts chemistry or life. Differs at full size on density but not at half size after the 3-measure correction (or the sign flips): fails the half-size check. (The original v3 lock used plain 3 sigma per measure; v0 cards add the Bonferroni correction, which is stricter.)"
